    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locals from the nearby village have gone mad with a new discovery. Their eyes filled blue flame, some being physically altered, gaining unseen strength. The enchanting blue flames burn hotter than anything ever previously known. Fight your way through to the source of what is causing all the chaos around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you succumb to the blue flames yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced, Snappy Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone Your Reflexes to Overcome Your Enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530550/extras/a4efc1b7b925a4b23ac8a2cd2ba11829.poster.avif?t=1749831141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530550/extras/a4efc1b7b925a4b23ac8a2cd2ba11829.webm?t=1749831141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530550/extras/a4efc1b7b925a4b23ac8a2cd2ba11829.mp4?t=1749831141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br><br>Unrelenting Bosses</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vicious Foes Stand in Your Way, You Must Push Through and Learn how to Overcome Their Strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530550/extras/2fe2e879ac5a2d6395c95e7a360b5c3c.poster.avif?t=1749831141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530550/extras/2fe2e879ac5a2d6395c95e7a360b5c3c.webm?t=1749831141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530550/extras/2fe2e879ac5a2d6395c95e7a360b5c3c.mp4?t=1749831141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br><br>Expansive Levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the Secrets of this Mysterious and Dark World. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530550/extras/ed38a9793a73ae9ed780e04e4a045f59.poster.avif?t=1749831141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530550/extras/ed38a9793a73ae9ed780e04e4a045f59.webm?t=1749831141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530550/extras/ed38a9793a73ae9ed780e04e4a045f59.mp4?t=1749831141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locals from the nearby village have gone mad with a new discovery. Their eyes filled blue flame, some being physically altered, gaining unseen strength. The enchanting blue flames burn hotter than anything ever previously known. Fight your way through to the source of what is causing all the chaos around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you succumb to the blue flames yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced, Snappy Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone Your Reflexes to Overcome Your Enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530550/extras/a4efc1b7b925a4b23ac8a2cd2ba11829.poster.avif?t=1749831141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530550/extras/a4efc1b7b925a4b23ac8a2cd2ba11829.webm?t=1749831141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530550/extras/a4efc1b7b925a4b23ac8a2cd2ba11829.mp4?t=1749831141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br><br>Unrelenting Bosses</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vicious Foes Stand in Your Way, You Must Push Through and Learn how to Overcome Their Strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530550/extras/2fe2e879ac5a2d6395c95e7a360b5c3c.poster.avif?t=1749831141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530550/extras/2fe2e879ac5a2d6395c95e7a360b5c3c.webm?t=1749831141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530550/extras/2fe2e879ac5a2d6395c95e7a360b5c3c.mp4?t=1749831141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br><br>Expansive Levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the Secrets of this Mysterious and Dark World. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530550/extras/ed38a9793a73ae9ed780e04e4a045f59.poster.avif?t=1749831141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530550/extras/ed38a9793a73ae9ed780e04e4a045f59.webm?t=1749831141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530550/extras/ed38a9793a73ae9ed780e04e4a045f59.mp4?t=1749831141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
